#: 57d739bd3a524baf9ae471daa9f6eeb5
msgid ""
"**Processor** -  Intel® Atom™ x7-Z8700 Processor -  2.4 GHz burst, quad "
"core, 2M cache, 64 bit -  4GB RAM LPDDR3-1600 -  32GB eMMC"
msgstr ""
